    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/4c85bd91476be3744573cfa753339318.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Feather</strong> is a short point-and-click game inspired by the fairy tale of the Brothers Grimm. A story that will take you on an unforgettable journey and offer a delightful narrative. The captivating visuals and interesting tasks will keep you entertained. Allow yourself to relax and immerse yourself in this atmospheric fairy tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/bc0e93d6c66d4a3add8669bed0793475.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a fool become a king?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of the adventure of a young prince a fool, who embarks on a journey to find the golden bird at the king\u2019s command, but along the way, he encounters something far more valuable. To reach a fairy tale ending, the fool must solve many riddles and show courage, for only the best can become king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/9b2b05afc5ef9ad950a5b7b3cf48306f.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiet and Peaceful</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of constant stress and negativity? Allow yourself to unwind! This story is free of any negativity or obstacles, of good or evil. It\u2019s a fairy tale for one evening that will bring you peace, and the beautiful visuals and pleasant music will help you dive into a fantastical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/56e8dc61380593e63f4e0cc725fd7f74.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for an adventure?</strong><br>In every fairy tale, the hero gets a happy ending, but it\u2019s not easy\u2014prepare yourself! In this magical world, many exciting things await you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and collectible items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game uses machine translation for the text, and I hope you understand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/d1948aac57bd543443164cbb724b7b05.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/4c85bd91476be3744573cfa753339318.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Feather</strong> is a short point-and-click game inspired by the fairy tale of the Brothers Grimm. A story that will take you on an unforgettable journey and offer a delightful narrative. The captivating visuals and interesting tasks will keep you entertained. Allow yourself to relax and immerse yourself in this atmospheric fairy tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/bc0e93d6c66d4a3add8669bed0793475.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a fool become a king?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of the adventure of a young prince a fool, who embarks on a journey to find the golden bird at the king\u2019s command, but along the way, he encounters something far more valuable. To reach a fairy tale ending, the fool must solve many riddles and show courage, for only the best can become king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/9b2b05afc5ef9ad950a5b7b3cf48306f.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiet and Peaceful</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of constant stress and negativity? Allow yourself to unwind! This story is free of any negativity or obstacles, of good or evil. It\u2019s a fairy tale for one evening that will bring you peace, and the beautiful visuals and pleasant music will help you dive into a fantastical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/56e8dc61380593e63f4e0cc725fd7f74.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for an adventure?</strong><br>In every fairy tale, the hero gets a happy ending, but it\u2019s not easy\u2014prepare yourself! In this magical world, many exciting things await you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and collectible items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game uses machine translation for the text, and I hope you understand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336150/extras/d1948aac57bd543443164cbb724b7b05.avif?t=1731661018\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p>",
